WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:02.708
- [Narrator:] Welcome to 100 seasons of Gridiron Heights!

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:05.958
- [Robert Irsay:] SHHHH, Baltimore will hear you! What a prank.

00:00:06.208 --> 00:00:07.791
- Maybe nobody noticed the butt thing.

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:09.708
- OK, I LOST, SO SEW IT BACK ON!

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.583
- I’M SCRAMBLING TO FIND THE SEAM!

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.625
- [Narrator:] Gridiron Heights began in 1920 as league propaganda.

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:21.458
But the show didn’t gain popularity until its 1950s breakout star.

00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:24.166
- I’m Johnny Unitas, see, and I shoot really well.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.791
- Yeah, I had a Johnny Unitas Gridiron Heights lunchbox growing up. 

00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:27.375
Who didn’t?

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.291
- [Interviewer:] The question was how do you feel about the Niners loss?

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:31.500
- Oh, I stopped feeling things a long time ago.

00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:34.125
- [Narrator:] The '80s and '90s featured more beloved characters.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.458
- OH NO. STOP, IT’S ME, WILLIAM “REFRIGERATOR” PERRY.

00:00:36.458 --> 00:00:37.541
OH, THAT’S MY STOMACH!

00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:40.500
- SLIME TIME? I THOUGHT YOU WAS TALKIN' ABOUT PRIME TIME!

00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:43.083
Don’t forget to watch me on DIAMOND HEIGHTS, RIGHT AFTER THIS.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:45.500
- DUHHHHH WHY CAN’T I GET A RING?!

00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.583
I never really liked my character on the show.

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:49.541
- YEAH, SAME, I DON’T SOUND LIKE THAT.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:52.333
- [Narrator:] And while several “lost episodes” have been banned over the years,

00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:55.625
the show has lasted 100 seasons thanks to the many classics.

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.875
- Where should I put my congrats card?!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:58.708
- ELI, NO!

00:00:58.791 --> 00:00:59.791
- AHHHHHHHH!

00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:03.208
- Hello youngsters,

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.833
if you enjoyed this moving picture and would like to watch more,

00:01:05.833 --> 00:01:08.833
simply subscribe by sending all your personal information and exactly

00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:12.875
3 American cents to 100 Gridiron Heights Way.

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.125
Thank you, and remember,

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.416
only WE can take down the commies!

